From 45f20303afc066db9898a6407a8233ab37ff0d78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 04:02:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] decrypt: support unified-lock clone profiles

Clone/managed profiles that share the parent lock only have gatekeeper.profile.key. After the parent authenticates, unwrap the profile key with keystore2, derive the random profile password, and run the normal synthetic-password path for that user.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Decrypt.cpp | 268 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 264 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

